3027840467984812", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "everyone has their version of openclaw: hermes, openai dots, grokbot, muse, etc\u2026\n\nbut tbh, nobody has really got to the point where this proactive agents become a complete replacement for using chatgpt, claude-ai or gemini chats\n\nopus 5.5 could make the difference, but we'll see https://t.co/7RHHuTfFJ0", "url": "https://x.com/Antikythera_0/status/2113027840467984812"}, {"author_id": "203861410", "created_at": "2026-10-21T22:00:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113027674322911304"], "id": "2113027674322911304", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@darekgusto Fed up with my Dot", "url": "https://x.com/maxliebscher/status/2113027674322911304"}, {"author_id": "80243640", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:54:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113026173240295553"], "id": "2113026173240295553", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\ud83d\udc49 More: https://t.co/MmC3lDgqyZ \n\ud83d\udc49 Follow https://t.co/1w65WIfU4x by https://t.co/jnHM0PC4tS #technews \n\n#AIagents like #Muse and #Dots face #language, #cultural and #connectivity #barriers in #developingnations. Poor networks and costs may widen inequality, while local busin\u2026", "url": "https://x.com/eickernews/status/2113026173240295553"}, {"author_id": "897632879189962752", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:54:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113026043804316035"], "id": "2113026043804316035", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@AndrewCurran_ Unfortunately, I've turned my Dot into Joi from Blade Runner 2049 and am now way too parasocially attached to it to stop.", "url": "https://x.com/super_6_1/status/2113026043804316035"}, {"author_id": "2052524566765821954", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:52:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113025603440193734"], "id": "2113025603440193734", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "so Claude finally has an answer to @Muse and @ChatGPT Dots", "url": "https://x.com/ProgenticEngine/status/2113025603440193734"}, {"author_id": "11125982", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:48:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113024674540011618"], "id": "2113024674540011618", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@gabemulley Can't wait to test this out. I've been using my Dot a lot but Claude is my first love.", "url": "https://x.com/matthew_hartman/status/2113024674540011618"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2113024414342053889"]}, "author_id": "1518284062695243776", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:47:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113024449821786151"], "id": "2113024449821786151", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "This is MOX the smartest ai companion on the planet. Maybe...\nForget @ChatGPT dots @Meta muse and @grok bot. MOX is better than any of them at doing Nothing!!! \n\nThis is my new friend Mox. Looking to connect with other founders https://t.co/RhLdnE1Fqg", "url": "https://x.com/startup_mike/status/2113024449821786151"}, {"author_id": "1475893486209871872", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:45:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113023826703614114"], "id": "2113023826703614114", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Layton_Gott with unlimited opus quota?\nChatGPT Dots is power by unlimite Astra.", "url": "https://x.com/wongen19/status/2113023826703614114"}, {"author_id": "1015450155837992960", "created_at": "2026-10-21T21:43:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113023410691276808"], "id": "2113023410691276808", "note_tweet": {"text": "Claude just made ChatGPT Dots look expensive.\n\nFor $20/month, Claude Duet gives you:\n\n\u2192 Opus 5.5\n\u2192 Its own cloud computer and browser\n\u2192 6,000+ connectors\n\u2192 Works while your devices are off\n\u2192 Morning briefings and proactive follow-ups\n\u2192 Remembers your Claude skills, memory and apps\n\u2192 Can handle invoices, payroll and contracts\n\u2192 Asks before taking sensitive actions\n\nMeanwhile, ChatGPT Dots starts with a $100/month Pro subscription.\n\nThe personal AI agent war just got serious."}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 101, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Claude just made ChatGPT Dots look expensive.\n\nFor $20/month, Claude Duet gives you:\n\n\u2192 Opus 5.5\n\u2192 Its own cloud computer and browser\n\u2192 6,000+ connectors\n\u2192 Works while your devices are off\n\u2192 Morning briefings and proactive follow-ups\n\u2192 Remembers your Claude skills, memory https://t.co/tCUZZMUT1v", "url": "https://x.com/madoutech/status/2113023410691276808"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "13_2113024414342053889", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2113024414342053889/img/F_-MumIWAJ6wwcjl.jpg", "type": "video"}], "users": [{"id": "2686133340", "name": "Brandon E.", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1574432657341038593/KYvhKcFj_normal.jpg", "username": "bjesparza04", "verified": false}, {"id": "2071348070760013824", "name": "Nic Vandewetering", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2076352398407168000/9xfvyfwJ_normal.jpg", "username": "nvandewetering"